<title>USA: Newmont wants merger with Santa Fe.</title>
<headline>Newmont wants merger with Santa Fe.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newmont Mining Corp said on Thursday it has proposed a merger with Santa Fe Pacific Gold Corp in a tax-free stock swap worth more than $2 billion.</p>
<p>The merger would create the largest gold company in North America, Denver-based Newmont said.</p>
</text>
